ember 2026 on 26 November 2026, with net profit surging and revenue at RM52.4 million. On the same day, all resolutions at the 2026 AGM were passed. Recently, the Chairman and Group CEO sold shares, and intraday short selling was suspended.","notable_en":["The company announced its quarterly results for the period ended 30 September 2026, with net profit surging and revenue at RM52.4 million.","The 2026 Annual General Meeting was held on 26 November, and all resolutions were passed by shareholders.","The company declared a final dividend of 0.25 sen per share for the financial year ended 30 June 2026, which was paid on 20 November."],"risks_en":["The company's Chairman, Dato' Ng Meng Kee, disposed of shares multiple times in March 2026.","The company's Group Chief Operating Officer, Jason Francis White, disposed of shares in October 2026.","The company's shares recently experienced unusual market activity, and short selling was suspended."],"earnings_en":"For the latest quarter ended 30 September 2026, revenue was RM42.12 million, down 7.6% QoQ but up 77.9% YoY; net profit was RM3.50 million with a net margin of 8.3%, turning positive from -0.3% in the previous quarter."}